			"updated": 1787586294213,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "UDP - User Datagram Protocol",
			"rawText": "UDP - User Datagram Protocol",
			"fontSize": 28,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "UDP - User Datagram Protocol",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"hasTextLink": false
		},
		{
			"id": "Smea6w0K",
			"type": "text",
			"x": -345.3453609361792,
			"y": -244.0707408027372,
			"width": 838.3394165039062,
			"height": 300,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1971c2",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 2,
			"strokeStyle": "solid",
			"roughness": 1,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "a1",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 39320041,
			"version": 737,
			"versionNonce": 191199623,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": null,
			"updated": 1787586842983,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "-> It is a Layer 4 (Transport Layer) Protocol\n-> Data Unit is called Datagram.\n-> We have a concept of PORTs to address processes in the host.\n-> It's a stateless protocol.\n-> Does not require connection establishment\n(Unlike TCP's 3 way handshake)\n-> Very simple protocol for communication.\n-> Header size of UDP datagram is 8 bytes. \n-> As it is a stateless protocol, it is unreliable.\n-> It just generates the Datagram and send it over internet. No checking or anything\n-> Very Fast compared to TCP but is not reliable.\n->Audio / Video Streaming Platform or Gaming Platform uses UDP.",
			"rawText": "-> It is a Layer 4 (Transport Layer) Protocol\n-> Data Unit is called Datagram.\n-> We have a concept of PORTs to address processes in the host.\n-> It's a stateless protocol.\n-> Does not require connection establishment\n(Unlike TCP's 3 way handshake)\n-> Very simple protocol for communication.\n-> Header size of UDP datagram is 8 bytes. \n-> As it is a stateless protocol, it is unreliable.\n-> It just generates the Datagram and send it over internet. No checking or anything\n-> Very Fast compared to TCP but is not reliable.\n->Audio / Video Streaming Platform or Gaming Platform uses UDP.",
			"fontSize": 20,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "-> It is a Layer 4 (Transport Layer) Protocol\n-> Data Unit is called Datagram.\n-> We have a concept of PORTs to address processes in the host.\n-> It's a stateless protocol.\n-> Does not require connection establishment\n(Unlike TCP's 3 way handshake)\n-> Very simple protocol for communication.\n-> Header size of UDP datagram is 8 bytes. \n-> As it is a stateless protocol, it is unreliable.\n-> It just generates the Datagram and send it over internet. No checking or anything\n-> Very Fast compared to TCP but is not reliable.\n->Audio / Video Streaming Platform or Gaming Platform uses UDP.",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"hasTextLink": false
		},
		{
			"id": "ykB5slBp",
			"type": "text",
			"x": -344.8132009959802,
			"y": 75.42948537682969,
			"width": 779.8794555664062,
			"height": 225,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#e03131",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 2,
			"strokeStyle": "solid",
			"roughness": 1,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"index": "a2",
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 816119303,
			"version": 372,
			"versionNonce": 663483015,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": null,
			"updated": 1787587279724,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Use Cases for UDP:\n-> WebRTC\n-> Gameplay Traffic\n->Video Streaming\n->VPN\n->DNS -> If DNS build on TCP it will take 11 Trips instead UDP takes 2 Trip \nAslo DNS itself has a mechanism to detect package loss.\n->QUIC -> takes Fast Property of UDP and implement reliablity from thier side.\n",
			"rawText": "Use Cases for UDP:\n-> WebRTC\n-> Gameplay Traffic\n->Video Streaming\n->VPN\n->DNS -> If DNS build on TCP it will take 11 Trips instead UDP takes 2 Trip \nAslo DNS itself has a mechanism to detect package loss.\n->QUIC -> takes Fast Property of UDP and implement reliablity from thier side.\n",
			"fontSize": 20,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "Use Cases for UDP:\n-> WebRTC\n-> Gameplay Traffic\n->Video Streaming\n->VPN\n->DNS -> If DNS build on TCP it will take 11 Trips instead UDP takes 2 Trip \nAslo DNS itself has a mechanism to detect package loss.\n->QUIC -> takes Fast Property of UDP and implement reliablity from thier side.\n",
			"autoResize": true,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"hasTextLink": false
		},
